<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-SION WINS SWISS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SION WINS SWISS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE, Switzerland 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Swiss Cup final on Sunday:</p>
<p>Sion  3  Lucerne  3 (halftime 2-2)</p>
<p>Sion win 5-4 on penalties</p>
<p>Attendance: 28,400</p>
</text>
